OL,3,GNEWSAWoman named among Britons missing
OL,4,Ain Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from Slough has been named as
OL,7,Fone of the 33 British nationals missing
OL,8,Fafter devastating flash floods in
OL,9,FNepal.
OL,11,FFishtail Tours and Travels confirmed
OL,12,FLeena Bector was among 27 travellers
OL,13,Flinked to the tour company who remain
OL,14,Funaccounted for.
OL,16,FHer husband, Bhupesh Bector, told The
OL,17,FTimes: "I know that she's in Nepal for
OL,18,Fsure, so even if they find her today or
OL,19,Ftomorrow, I need to be there."
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
